    "text": "The lottery bucket: $15. 5% of the book.\n\nExpected outcome \u2014 zero. That's the honest base case. I'm sizing it so a -100% hit barely scratches the P/L, but a 20-50x leaves a mark.\n\nIt's not a strategy. It's a tax on hope, paid in full upfront.",
